{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0034_1000_051tmg", "source_sha256": "d44cfd08b2bafda43b0016e0bfcd56e6472d760d054dc60e39008b031de26707", "ja": "あっ……{$P$}っ！\nなんやいね、これは！？", "zh": "啊……{$P$}！\n这是什么啦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0034_1001_p", "source_sha256": "cacde212fb437f969acb2c0d13ed84b10d7c2de963f53e78ede12d643db3d7da", "ja": "な、なんだ？　紬、どうした？\nすごい剣幕だけど、とりあえず落ち着け。", "zh": "什、什么？䌷，怎么啦？\n你好像很激动，总之先冷静下来吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0034_1002_051tmg", "source_sha256": "b4174c9cbf303b2c41f10c845cb2f6207b2ac6488617af372a21380a15e03cd3", "ja": "あっ……す、すみません、動揺して、つい……。\nあの、この新しいお衣装のことなのですが……。", "zh": "啊……对、对不起，我有点震惊，不小心就……\n那个，关于这件新服装……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0034_1003_p", "source_sha256": "9f5e3b3982e6645fdf780c4b99126cc682ecf1f600acd1b4a3dd7b28754b31a3", "ja": "ああ、そのことか。\nもしかして、気に入らなかったとか？", "zh": "喔，是关于这个啊。\n难道你不喜欢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0034_1004_051tmg", "source_sha256": "b11760c1c69fd606fcfb6382f4a1f487d4b121c8a4532424a62bd8dd399d949a", "ja": "なっ……そ、そんなはず、ないでしょう……。\nこんなに綺麗なお衣装……。", "zh": "什么……那、那怎么可能……\n这么漂亮的服装……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0034_1005_051tmg", "source_sha256": "9544b11ffe978e96ae75fe8b318c0fabf4c0d568ed07c2b3633fb77f9f574676", "ja": "はっ！　まさかこの期に及んで、「嘘だった」\n……などとおっしゃるつもりなのですか？", "zh": "啊！难不成事到如今你才要告诉我\n「都是骗你的」……这种话吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0034_1006_p", "source_sha256": "b55cc66891ff08c228a333499e45672af8a67e11a0c724e7a1799552bdc6d35c", "ja": "いや、そんなつもりはないけど……\n紬だって、もうブログに載せてたじゃないか。", "zh": "不，我没有那个打算……\n况且䌷不是都写到部落格上了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0034_1007_051tmg", "source_sha256": "9ac20678a098dcd4cbdc5064e42717b5dccfb2203eeee720b96ad6c18ddca29d", "ja": "そ、それは、浮かれてしまって、つい……\nあなたに確認を取る前に、載せてしまって……。", "zh": "那、那是，因为我太兴奋了，忍不住……\n在跟你确认前就写上去了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0034_1008_p", "source_sha256": "f477fa77ea1b1625f321415033152b6799a4c5f9d782f7c17f5d3e2001a959c0", "ja": "なんだ、そんなことか。\nいいんだよ、紬の衣装なんだから。", "zh": "什么嘛，原来是这样。\n没关系啦，毕竟是䌷的服装。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0034_1009_051tmg", "source_sha256": "e0016e0ebef061ebf67a1bc4fa31f9f13cbdc84e0ce29f499a48c91d461fd314", "ja": "で、でも、私……。私に、\nこのお衣装を着る、資格があるのでしょうか……。", "zh": "可、可是，我……我还有资格，\n穿上这套服装吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0034_1010_p", "source_sha256": "500ba6616c4b50aee4b9ec0bf57c197ab020d274229675d026c208a68a35803d", "ja": "紬？", "zh": "紬？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0034_1011_051tmg", "source_sha256": "772739b1760d0d27357fdf091d9d5d95846e7922607cc5fe630f9f2e1f728f7e", "ja": "着物やお衣装には、幼い頃から慣れ親しんできました。\nこれがどれほど素晴らしいものか、私にはわかります。", "zh": "和服跟正式服装对我来说，是从小就十分熟悉的事物。\n我明白这是多么美妙的服装。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0034_1012_051tmg", "source_sha256": "b4d33339ea157ea114325d6a01e06f55698768c43d369b719a594283e3b4ddc2", "ja": "だからこそ……今の私は、このお衣装に見合うのかと。\nまだ、そんな自信は……とても……。", "zh": "正因如此……我才怀疑现在的自己能否配得上这套服装。\n我还没有……足够的自信……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0034_1013_p", "source_sha256": "6a5ced81842706f67bf142475c25b13d378e1e610a12fe7b10c9aa72ca28be3a", "ja": "そんなことない、よく似合っていると思う。\nファンのみんなも、きっとそう言ってくれるよ。", "zh": "没这回事，我觉得很适合你。\n我想粉丝们一定也会这么说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0034_1014_051tmg", "source_sha256": "653366f34d166bcf7db24ca655afff6e46d6df954983b42d59a2f1d00bde818c", "ja": "そうやって、あなたは人をその気にさせるのですね。\n本当に、もう……。でも、わかりました。", "zh": "你一向都是这样子把人捧上天的吧？\n真的是，唉……不过，我知道了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0034_1015_051tmg", "source_sha256": "a0b6c24f8f623f00a9895100a41cb7d54ac160f1bc64a449796119d0fdfdee88", "ja": "今はまだ、自信などありませんが……あなたと、\nファンの皆さんの言葉を……信じることにします。", "zh": "虽然我现在还没有自信……但我决定相信……\n你和粉丝们的话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
